# 1-Bit Full Adder

This project implements a **1-Bit Full Adder using NAND gates as Universal Gates** in VHDL.

### Features
- Uses only NAND gate instances
- Inputs: `A`, `B`, `Cin`
- Outputs: `Sum`, `Cout`
- Includes VHDL testbenches

### Files
- `NAND_GATE.vhd` – NAND Gate
- `NAND_GATE_TB.vhd` – NAND Gate Testbench
- `FULL_ADDER.vhd` – 1-Bit Full Adder
- `FULL_ADDER_TB.vhd` – Full Adder Testbench

### Tool
- VHDL
- Xilinx ISE
